WEBVTT

00:09:59.303 --> 00:10:03.098
And when it comes
to important legal questions,

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.642
let's be honest,

00:10:04.683 --> 00:10:07.811
what's more American
that a fight between lawyers?

00:10:07.853 --> 00:10:09.772
(Laughter)

00:10:09.772 --> 00:10:11.565
And we've done this in the past.

00:10:11.607 --> 00:10:14.943
The government has run
several pilot projects.

00:10:15.277 --> 00:10:20.032
Every time, support has proven enough
to get migrants out of prison,

00:10:20.074 --> 00:10:25.120
to keep them on top of their court dates
and away from trouble.

00:10:26.205 --> 00:10:28.874
But we've never let these projects grow.